WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.875
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:05.625
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:07.583
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:09.791
and start getting Real

00:00:09.791 --> 00:00:10.625
This is

00:00:10.625 --> 00:00:11.958
The Champions

00:00:12.166 --> 00:00:13.166
I’m Fellaini

00:00:13.166 --> 00:00:15.458
and in this show, I will NEVER cut my hair

00:00:16.958 --> 00:00:18.416
Sorry—sorry I’m late

00:00:18.416 --> 00:00:19.875
Uh, hello! I’m—

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:23.041
I am very happy for Luka that he won the Ballon d’Or

00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:26.125
But mainly that Ronaldo didn’t win! Hahah!

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.833
I’m Phil Jones and nobody wants to face me

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:31.291
AND NOBODY WANTS ME FACE!

00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:32.083
Robben, can you check your feet?

00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:33.041
Make sure you’re on your mark

00:00:33.041 --> 00:00:34.416
Oh, sure, yeah

00:00:34.416 --> 00:00:35.666
Wait, I have two of these?!

00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:45.375
Say, have I ever told you about the time

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:48.208
my partner and I took a picture together with David Beckham?

00:00:48.208 --> 00:00:48.750
Get this

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:52.291
it was seven years before we even started courting each other

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:53.666
Oh really?

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:54.291
That’s dope

00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:56.000
Easy peasy now, bruv

00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:58.625
Just hit this anywhere on the board and we win

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:04.166
Brilliant, Mahrez. Now can you turn the lights back on?

00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:07.958
AAAAHHHHHHH!!!

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:08.916
Neymar!

00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:10.416
He’s been murdered!

00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:12.208
Oh my dear Neymar

00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:14.250
What kind of animal would do this?!

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.125
Suarez!

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:17.125
Whoa...OK, hold on.

00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:18.000
I’m a biter

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:18.750
That’s my thing

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:19.416
I bite

00:01:19.416 --> 00:01:20.208
This guy?

00:01:20.208 --> 00:01:21.166
He was stabbed

00:01:21.166 --> 00:01:24.958
This is a backstabbing, and who is the biggest backstabber of them all?

00:01:26.041 --> 00:01:27.000
Uh

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.708
John Terry?

00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:30.000
MAURO ICARDI!

00:01:30.416 --> 00:01:33.416
If he can take a man’s wife, he can take a man’s LIFE!

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.000
And he does it with a knife

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.333
and he causes all this strife

00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:41.250
OK, hold on. The only crime I am guilty of is falling in love.

00:01:42.291 --> 00:01:43.916
OK, yes, with my friend’s wife

00:01:43.916 --> 00:01:47.041
and then marrying her and then getting a tattoo of his three kids

00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:48.958
OK, yeah, it’s messed up. I get it...

00:01:48.958 --> 00:01:51.000
but I only metaphorically backstab

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.125
Whoever did this

00:01:52.125 --> 00:01:54.208
is someone with a REAL history of violence

00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:54.916
Someone like

00:01:54.916 --> 00:01:56.291
SERGIO RAMOS!

00:01:56.291 --> 00:01:57.375
Ah yeah, yeah, yeah

00:01:57.375 --> 00:01:58.083
Stop, man

00:01:58.083 --> 00:01:59.416
I was with Mo the whole time

00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:00.625
It’s true

00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:01.583
unfortunately

00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:02.750
Nothing else to say

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.750
And besides, I have no reason to kill Neymar, unlike Coutinho!

00:02:06.791 --> 00:02:07.666
What?

00:02:07.666 --> 00:02:08.416
Yes, you!

00:02:08.416 --> 00:02:11.250
The dark wizard who wishes to have Neymar’s place

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.833
as the crown jewel of El Canarinho!

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.625
This is ridiculous! Me? Stop it.

00:02:15.625 --> 00:02:17.708
First of all, why is no one accusing Ronaldo?

00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:19.666
I mean, it’s a little weird that he’s not here, right?

00:02:19.666 --> 00:02:20.458
And we know that—

00:02:22.791 --> 00:02:25.833
What I mean is, if anyone wants Neymar out of the way, it’s

00:02:26.375 --> 00:02:27.250
Cavani!

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.375
It’s no secret they’ve had problems

00:02:29.375 --> 00:02:31.083
And it appears he has fixed them

00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:32.583
by MURDERING HIM!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.166
Except he did NOT

00:02:37.375 --> 00:02:38.708
And how do you know?

00:02:38.708 --> 00:02:41.916
Because I am Thomas Muller, the Raumdeuter

00:02:41.958 --> 00:02:44.500
also known as the SPACE INVESTIGATOR

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:46.208
I thought it was space interpreter

00:02:46.208 --> 00:02:49.333
Well, there’s no proper English translation, but really both are valid

00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:50.875
It’s very cool, actually

00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:52.375
Room, lock the doors to the Romelu

00:02:52.375 --> 00:02:53.666
I mean Romelu, Lukaku the doors

00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:54.083
I mean

00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:54.750
never mind

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.333
I will now investigate this space!

00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:59.333
Hey, talk about the MULLER investigation, am I right?

00:02:59.333 --> 00:03:00.041
Eh?

00:03:00.791 --> 00:03:03.333
You see, it could not be Cavani

00:03:03.333 --> 00:03:07.583
Because a cunning murderer like this requires an ELITE attacker

00:03:08.125 --> 00:03:09.250
I’m an elite attacker

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:12.875
Ah, you’re very good, but THIS was done by one of the best

00:03:12.916 --> 00:03:14.416
OK, well I am definitely one of the best

00:03:14.416 --> 00:03:15.666
so I think I should be a suspect

00:03:15.666 --> 00:03:19.083
Ze real perpetrator is someone who has worn ze red and blue

00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:20.166
but not anymore

00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:24.375
You see, zis person shouldn’t even be AT the Champions League house

00:03:24.416 --> 00:03:26.333
SHOW YOURSELF, ZLATAN!

00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:27.916
It is true! Haha!

00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:29.458
I am the best player in the world!

00:03:29.458 --> 00:03:31.541
Uh…that is not what I said.

00:03:31.541 --> 00:03:32.916
But I am not here to murder

00:03:32.958 --> 00:03:35.000
I am here to take what is rightfully mine!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.500
The Ballon d'Or!

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.625
Not as easy when you’re not in America anymore, eh?

00:03:38.625 --> 00:03:39.333
Enough with this

00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:41.166
We all know who the murderer is

00:03:41.166 --> 00:03:41.916
It is Paul

00:03:41.916 --> 00:03:44.041
Oh my God—enough with the “I hate Paul” act

00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:45.291
Hmm

00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:46.250
act

00:03:46.916 --> 00:03:47.833
Wait

00:03:47.833 --> 00:03:50.583
Who was ze the last person Neymar was talking with before he went dead?

00:03:50.583 --> 00:03:53.541
I was telling him the story about how I met my fiancée

00:03:53.541 --> 00:03:55.333
Ah! I’ve solved ze crime!

00:03:55.333 --> 00:03:56.208
Who did it?

00:03:56.208 --> 00:03:56.875
Nobody

00:03:56.875 --> 00:03:58.750
Because Neymar is not dead

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.208
He is merely play-acting!

00:04:01.458 --> 00:04:04.208
All to avoid small talk with Harry Kane!

00:04:04.208 --> 00:04:05.833
And I would have gotten away with it too

00:04:05.833 --> 00:04:09.166
if it weren’t for you pesky Germans and your technical quality!

00:04:09.625 --> 00:04:14.083
I shall flop agaaaaain!

